=======================================================
AERO AIRLINES - FLIGHT BOOKING CONFIRMATION
=======================================================

Hello <%= @passenger.name %>,

Thank you for booking with Aero Airlines! Your flight reservation has been successfully confirmed.

BOOKING REFERENCE: <%= @booking.booking_reference %>

-------------------------------------------------------
FLIGHT ITINERARY
-------------------------------------------------------
Flight Number:     <%= @flight.flight_number %>
Flight Date:       <%= @flight.formatted_full_date %>
Duration:          <%= @flight.formatted_duration %> (Non-stop)

Departure:
  Airport: <%= @departure_airport.name %> (<%= @departure_airport.code %>)
  City:    <%= @departure_airport.city %>
  Time:    <%= @flight.formatted_time %>

Arrival:
  Airport: <%= @arrival_airport.name %> (<%= @arrival_airport.code %>)
  City:    <%= @arrival_airport.city %>
  Time:    <%= @flight.formatted_arrival_time %>

-------------------------------------------------------
PASSENGER INFORMATION
-------------------------------------------------------
Passenger Name:  <%= @passenger.name %>
Passenger Email: <%= @passenger.email %>
Cabin Class:     Main Cabin
Status:          CONFIRMED
<% if @booking.passengers.count > 1 %>
Traveling With:  <%= @booking.passengers.reject { |p| p.id == @passenger.id }.map(&:name).join(", ") %>
<% end %>

-------------------------------------------------------
VIEW YOUR BOARDING PASS & ITINERARY ONLINE
-------------------------------------------------------
You can view your digital boarding pass and reservation details anytime at:
<%= @url %>

IMPORTANT TRAVEL INFORMATION:
Please arrive at the airport at least 2 hours prior to scheduled departure. Please bring valid government-issued photo identification.

Safe travels!
Aero Airlines Customer Care Team
=======================================================
